# Force LF in the working tree on every platform so the Windows CI runner's
# default core.autocrlf does not convert tracked files to CRLF (which biome's
# formatter then rejects). Connector OUTPUTS still preserve the user's EOL at
# runtime — that is handled in code (upsertBlock), not here.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Append-only shared log: union-merge so concurrent entries from both sides
# survive a rebase instead of producing line conflicts.
wiki/log.md merge=wikilog
